## Interface: 30300
## Title: Ashoholic - Ebonhold Roster
## Notes: Tracks characters, Soul Ash, Raid Reset Costs, and instance lockouts on Project Ebonhold. Hover a character name for saved lockouts and the 10-instance rolling-hour timer. A small widget keeps that timer on screen while the roster is closed. Adds a Character Roster tab to the Nexus panel when Nexus is installed.
## Author: Crimson, MarkusLastu
## Version: 3.0.0-ptr.5
